<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>12 / 自进化与扩展</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>缓存 ≠ 训练 ≠ 证实正确</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={330} viewBox='0 0 1140 330'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1140' height='73' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='570.0' y='30.5' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>公共知识库</text><text x='570.0' y='56.5' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>核实的课程内容、常见错误、评分依据、教学案例、适用条件</text><path d='M562 74 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='85' width='1140' height='73' rx='8' fill='#1B4E8C'/><text x='570.0' y='115.5' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>个人长期记忆</text><text x='570.0' y='141.5' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>学生自己的目标、证据、经确认信息，按个人权限，不混入他人上下文</text><path d='M562 159 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='170' width='1140' height='73' rx='8' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='570.0' y='200.5' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>应用缓存</text><text x='570.0' y='226.5' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>复用相同内容、版本、适用范围下的已验证结果，原资料变化后更新或失效</text><path d='M562 244 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='255' width='1140' height='73' rx='8' fill='#9FD0F5'/><text x='570.0' y='285.5' font-size='22' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>模型上下文或服务缓存</text><text x='570.0' y='311.5' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>降低重复传入开销或延迟</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #E8A33D', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>把易错案例加载到当前提示词，可以帮助这次生成参考先前经验；长期保存案例依赖知识库，参数层面的变化依赖训练。不能把“已经缓存”当作“已经训练”或“已经证实正确”</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：自进化与跨学科扩展设计.md §2.3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 117 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>